\caption{Eccentricity evolution of Jupiter ($e_1$) and Saturn ($e_2$) over $1$ million years. The top row compares $n$-body results (black) with first-order (blue) and second-order (red) secular models. The bottom row shows similar comparisons for the resonant secular models.}
