$\text{RMSE} = \sqrt{\tfrac{1}{N_\mathrm{det}}\sum_{j=1}^{N_\mathrm{det}}\bigl\| {\mathbf{p}}_j - {\widehat{\mathbf{p}}}_j \bigr\|^2}$, 
%\end{equation}
where $\mathbf{p}_j$ and $\hat{\mathbf{p}}_j$ denote true and estimated target positions, in local or global coordinates depending on the context.
